# Cross the flat rail at a right angle, ollie, grind: board across the rail, so a Boardslide (FS: the rail is on the toe side, the rider ends up facing back down it).
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -7 1.4 0.14 0
hold up 6..80
hold ollie 70..90
tap grind 128
bot balance
run 500
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Boardslide,slide=true} within 124..140
expect event grindEnd{trick=FS Boardslide} within 135..330
expect event comboLanded{name=FS Boardslide} within 140..420
expect no event bail
